        "raw": "So I was re-listening to that episode (which is nearly two years old at this point) and at one point they get a question asking:\n\n> \"Can we get links to the various “GTG people play the RPG” things to make catching up on their “canon until decided otherwise” events?\"\n\nTo which the response is:\n\n> \"Sure, check the show notes.\"\n\nWhich would be great, but when you check the show notes, it says:\n\n> * Can we get links to the various “GTG people play the RPG” things to make catching up on their “canon until decided otherwise” events? Sure, check the show notes.\n\nAnd that's it.  There are no links anywhere in the notes that I can see, and if the wiki has a big page of collected actual plays it's eluding me.  \n\nAnyone know where this info would be?",
