        "created_at": "2024-05-10T00:30:38.630Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The links to playlists are on this page where it says Season 1, Season 2, and Season 3</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\" data-onebox-src=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-55\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n\n      <a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">theletterspage.libsyn.com</a>\n  </header>\n\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e8f0e30642cb431fc91f2966c42fc88c50d9fcb5.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail onebox-avatar\" width=\"250\" height=\"250\">\n\n<h3><a href=\"https://theletterspage.libsyn.com/editors-note-55\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Letters Page: Editor's Note #55</a></h3>\n\n  <p>A irregularly recorded but regularly released Editor's Note! Show Notes: Run Time: 1:34:34 We talk about many things, but first, the schedule! Upcoming schedule:  Tuesday, June 7th: Episode #215: Writers' Room — Disparation: Inversiverse Galactra...</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n\n<p>I’ll post them out here too:<br>\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLBZBled0v3sKH7y_VtIQL2j-8pfpRUUgH&amp;wmode=transparent&amp;rel=0&amp;autohide=1&amp;showinfo=1&amp;enablejsapi=1\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" seamless=\"seamless\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-presentation\"></iframe>\n<br>\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLBZBled0v3sJiwpYwt0yBCLdORyefz4rW&amp;wmode=transparent&amp;rel=0&amp;autohide=1&amp;showinfo=1&amp;enablejsapi=1\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" seamless=\"seamless\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-presentation\"></iframe>\n<br>\n            <iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/videoseries?list=PLBZBled0v3sLD5-waiAuasHkKr6AALO-Z&amp;wmode=transparent&amp;rel=0&amp;autohide=1&amp;showinfo=1&amp;enablejsapi=1\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" seamless=\"seamless\" sandbox=\"allow-same-origin allow-scripts allow-forms allow-popups allow-popups-to-escape-sandbox allow-presentation\"></iframe>\n</p>",
